        "text": "Working with Long Commands\nAs you become used to the command line, you should find some shortcuts to ease\nyour typing chores. In this section, I show you some features of the bash shell\ndesigned to make your life on the command line as pleasant as possible. These\nfeatures include command-line completion, editing, and using the history of pre-\nviously entered commands.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Asking Linux to complete a command or filename for you\n\u2022 Accessing your command history\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
